WEBVTT

01:01.720 --> 01:03.000
Young Master.

01:05.680 --> 01:06.960
Young Master.

01:16.480 --> 01:17.480
Don’t move.

01:18.120 --> 01:19.160
You're seriously injured.

01:19.160 --> 01:20.360
You need to rest.

01:21.520 --> 01:22.800
Where's Lunar?

01:32.759 --> 01:34.039
Do you want me to say it again?

01:34.920 --> 01:37.720
I want you to be naked.

01:39.680 --> 01:42.960
to get the key

01:42.960 --> 01:46.360
to save those lowly bandits.

01:47.360 --> 01:50.479
Do you want them to die

01:50.840 --> 01:52.600
or do you want them to live?

01:55.280 --> 01:57.039
How could she save us?

02:02.720 --> 02:04.680
This He Lian Cheng is really something.

02:04.680 --> 02:06.920
He knew you were determined and couldn't be destroyed,

02:07.520 --> 02:09.320
so he made such a bad move.

02:09.320 --> 02:10.400
If you don't agree,

02:10.800 --> 02:13.480
All saving people before was a joke.

02:13.760 --> 02:14.880
If you do,

02:15.360 --> 02:17.560
the royal dignity will be ruined.

02:18.000 --> 02:21.120
will be tolerated by the royal family and the country.

02:21.800 --> 02:24.120
It seems that lowly people are lowly.

02:25.120 --> 02:28.520
I don't deserve your pity.

02:30.000 --> 02:32.200
A gentleman always keeps his word.

02:33.720 --> 02:35.720
You're talking nonsense.

02:36.600 --> 02:38.800
Do you think I am a fool?

02:40.040 --> 02:41.480
I will believe you.

02:44.600 --> 02:45.400
Your Highness.

02:46.120 --> 02:47.760
Please be kind.

02:48.440 --> 02:49.760
My child is still young.

02:50.160 --> 02:51.960
Please be kind.

02:52.160 --> 02:52.880
That's right.

02:54.079 --> 02:56.960
We got caught because of you.

02:57.240 --> 02:58.880
You have to save us.

02:59.240 --> 03:00.400
That's right.

03:00.400 --> 03:03.520
Please.

03:04.080 --> 03:05.520
Please save us.

03:05.520 --> 03:07.120
Please.

03:07.120 --> 03:08.560
Please save us.

03:09.160 --> 03:10.600
Even if she takes it off,

03:10.960 --> 03:12.400
we'll die too.

03:14.640 --> 03:15.800
It seems that

03:16.600 --> 03:20.440
can't make the noble Empress Dowager fall in love.

03:21.040 --> 03:22.200
Bring her in.

03:34.720 --> 03:36.400
Mother.

03:38.280 --> 03:40.120
Lunar.

03:46.640 --> 03:48.680
What did you do to her?

03:52.240 --> 03:53.000
Then...

03:53.800 --> 03:55.400
let's start the game.

03:56.520 --> 03:58.120
If you don't want to take it off,

03:59.360 --> 04:01.000
I'll start killing.

04:03.040 --> 04:04.560
Who should I start with?

04:13.320 --> 04:14.120
You...

04:15.720 --> 04:16.519
Or...

04:17.680 --> 04:18.480
You...

04:20.800 --> 04:22.440
Then...

04:22.440 --> 04:24.480
start with you.

04:24.480 --> 04:27.800
A delicate little girl.

04:30.880 --> 04:31.920
Are you taking it off?

04:34.600 --> 04:35.400
Three.

04:39.520 --> 04:40.080
Two.

05:00.800 --> 05:02.120
I was born naked.

05:04.200 --> 05:05.840
I'm not afraid of taking off my clothes.

05:10.880 --> 05:11.680
He Lian Cheng.

05:13.760 --> 05:14.840
I want to thank you.

05:15.880 --> 05:17.640
You made the decision for me.

05:33.800 --> 05:34.680
I will repay

05:37.240 --> 05:39.159
for raising me.

05:40.520 --> 05:41.840
From now on,

05:42.480 --> 05:44.280
no matter alive or dead,

05:46.240 --> 05:49.920
I have nothing to do with you.

06:02.280 --> 06:03.400
In the past,

06:05.680 --> 06:08.800
read all the books of sages in the world

06:11.600 --> 06:14.000
and control the supreme power in the world.

06:15.520 --> 06:17.360
but only knows to live in peace.

06:19.520 --> 06:23.240
I never thought of seeking peace for the people.

06:26.000 --> 06:27.400
It’s your fault

06:28.680 --> 06:30.080
is the fault of the ruler.

06:31.360 --> 06:32.480
It's also my fault.

06:35.920 --> 06:37.760
I'm sorry.

06:59.080 --> 07:00.520
Lunar.

10:09.920 --> 10:11.600
I'm sorry.

10:11.600 --> 10:13.280
I’m late.

10:19.320 --> 10:20.800
Greetings, Young Master.

10:21.960 --> 10:23.120
You may leave.

10:23.120 --> 10:24.000
Yes.

10:27.000 --> 10:28.040
Let's go.

10:32.480 --> 10:34.160
Brother.

10:38.720 --> 10:40.360
I tried so hard

10:40.960 --> 10:42.760
to help you recover.

10:43.760 --> 10:44.960
But for her,

10:47.080 --> 10:49.160
You're an unrestrained demon queen.

10:49.160 --> 10:51.320
disregarded her own safety and forced her to use magic.

10:51.920 --> 10:54.160
Is my sacrifice so worthless?

10:54.840 --> 10:56.840
Is this Demon Queen so precious?

10:56.840 --> 10:57.600
Man.

10:57.600 --> 10:58.960
Don’t call me Ban.

11:00.640 --> 11:01.800
You’ve changed.

11:03.600 --> 11:05.160
You forgot your original intention.

11:06.920 --> 11:09.400
Have you forgotten that you escaped

11:09.400 --> 11:10.640
and endured humiliation,

11:11.080 --> 11:13.840
to compromise under Baili Jinghong

11:14.640 --> 11:16.160
to make the Helin Clan

11:16.160 --> 11:19.040
to stop being a gold mine slave.

11:21.720 --> 11:24.480
But you were bewitched by Ji Mingyue's beauty.

11:26.840 --> 11:28.720
You are not my brother.

11:28.720 --> 11:29.920
You are not.

12:07.240 --> 12:08.040
Young Master.

12:09.720 --> 12:10.520
Young Master.

12:10.840 --> 12:12.520
Moo-yeol led the army to Colorless City.

12:12.800 --> 12:13.680
He said

12:14.280 --> 12:15.680
to hand over the Empress Dowager.

12:34.320 --> 12:38.760
Brother.

12:41.280 --> 12:42.320
Second Young Master, wait.

12:42.800 --> 12:43.280
You know

12:43.280 --> 12:45.320
how important the Empress Dowager and General Shen are to him.

12:47.520 --> 12:48.320
Brother.

13:14.240 --> 13:16.800
She's just a piece of trash born by a lowly servant in the general's mansion.

13:17.480 --> 13:19.840
I've been teaching her for ten years.

13:20.360 --> 13:21.680
That's how she is now.

13:23.480 --> 13:24.520
But you are different.

13:25.040 --> 13:26.320
You're gifted.

13:27.040 --> 13:28.720
is nothing compared to her.

13:30.160 --> 13:31.400
Over 20 years,

13:32.000 --> 13:34.360
Is all the kindness you did for me fake?

13:34.960 --> 13:36.520
If you're not my mother,

13:37.320 --> 13:39.200
then who is my mother?

13:40.040 --> 13:41.480
Here.

13:41.480 --> 13:43.080
Cheers.

13:45.160 --> 13:46.200
I didn't know.

13:46.200 --> 13:47.840
This girl is so handsome.

13:47.840 --> 13:49.240
Judging from what you mean,

13:49.720 --> 13:51.040
you want to enjoy it alone.

13:51.040 --> 13:52.680
Let's just watch.

13:53.440 --> 13:54.280
Not necessarily.

13:54.600 --> 13:56.960
Maybe we can share the soup.

13:57.160 --> 13:58.400
Right?

13:58.880 --> 14:00.560
Let's drink.

14:07.880 --> 14:08.720
Please spare my life.

14:09.120 --> 14:10.240
I didn't mean it.

14:13.600 --> 14:14.880
I think

14:14.880 --> 14:16.120
on purpose.

14:19.720 --> 14:21.800
You stained my clothes.

14:23.800 --> 14:24.680
Then you pay for it.

14:26.120 --> 14:27.320
No, sir.

14:38.120 --> 14:39.840
So strong

14:43.280 --> 14:44.800
The fiercer you are,

14:44.800 --> 14:46.200
the more I like it.

14:49.440 --> 14:50.240
Stop!

14:52.320 --> 14:53.640
Robbery a civilian.

14:53.640 --> 14:54.440
Moo-yeol.

14:54.880 --> 14:56.400
How dare you!

14:57.400 --> 15:00.080
Your Highness, you must be mistaken.

15:00.680 --> 15:02.040
She's just a captive.

15:04.200 --> 15:07.520
I can do whatever I want.

15:07.720 --> 15:10.400
It's not a great man

15:11.680 --> 15:13.400
is not done by a man.

15:13.400 --> 15:16.920
Your Highness, there's something you don't know.

15:17.360 --> 15:18.880
You're high and mighty.

15:19.080 --> 15:22.360
Of course you don't know how hard our soldiers are.

15:22.360 --> 15:26.000
We rough people tied our heads to the belt.

15:26.200 --> 15:27.800
to lick blood.

15:28.360 --> 15:29.400
For what?

15:29.680 --> 15:30.880
are just two things.

15:31.200 --> 15:32.800
Rong Yao.

15:32.800 --> 15:33.760
Woman.

15:35.800 --> 15:36.960
Your Highness.

15:36.960 --> 15:38.440
You want to save her?

15:38.880 --> 15:41.200
I want someone.

15:42.360 --> 15:43.880
You want to show off?

15:44.360 --> 15:46.520
I'll excuse myself.

15:49.160 --> 15:49.960
Let's go.

15:50.400 --> 15:51.200
Moo-yeol.

15:55.920 --> 15:58.320
Why did your general arrest me?

15:59.280 --> 16:01.040
I believe you can guess one or two.

16:02.840 --> 16:03.440
I know

16:03.440 --> 16:06.160
I won’t live long under General Baili.

16:08.560 --> 16:11.280
But before he takes me to the capital,

16:12.080 --> 16:14.400
he will obey me.

16:17.440 --> 16:19.240
He will let

16:20.240 --> 16:22.000
whoever I tell him to die.

16:23.080 --> 16:24.880
Do you believe it?
